# Vendored third-party build output. Nothing here is ever edited by hand, so
# take it byte for byte: `-text` keeps `core.autocrlf=true` away from the two
# minified JS files, and `binary` keeps a diff from trying to render 2.8 MB of
# WebAssembly (or a gzip stream) as lines.
*        -text
*.wasm   binary
*.gz     binary
